    backlog:hasAuditNote "Rendered from the approved draft DRAFT_ch18_v1_0_1.md. Deck SEN0414_Ch18_CSVJSONXML_3e_v2_0_2.pptx (53 slides, unchanged count; the earlier deck stays), built by deck_build_v2_0_2.py from deck_content_v2_0_2.py; story slide 28 on the naming of Ajax (portrait of Jesse James Garrett, 25 April 2007, photo by Tim 'Avatar' Bartel, CC BY 2.5, Wikimedia Commons; credit on the slide), the story that repeated chapter 16 replaced as the draft says; manifest chapter_code_ch18_v1_0_2.json; sen0414_ch18_stories_v1_1_0.py; page sen0414_ch18_page_v9_96_1.html made from the page data and stories of this chapter. Checks run on 2026-11-11: manifest self-check PASS; deck standard check v1.0.0 PASS 13 of 13; deck overlap check CLEAN; 20 links answer 200; stories self-check 0 failures (6 stories); logs saved in 08-tooling/ch18-deck/logs_v2_0_2. Not clean: page test 9.37.0 stopped at 70 features passed, 0 failed, when the browser tab crashed (the accepted ch17 page v9_96_0 stops at the same place on this machine, so the remaining features are not verified here); deck standard check v1.1.0 is not used because it fails the accepted decks too. Facts: the picture was read as a 960 px Wikimedia thumbnail (full-size downloads refused with HTTP 429); the Ajax lesson line is at most 14 words (page story check); the resources slide is unchanged. Open for the owner: the story on ElementTree (ch18, story 5) uses the same Python 2.5 What's New page as the SQLite story of ch16; kept as drafted, owner has not ruled." .
